  "details": "When joining VRChat using the Open Beta, the world version loaded is different from the one loaded when using the non-beta (live) version of VRChat.\n\nSpecifically, the non-beta version correctly loads the latest version of the world, while the Open Beta client loads an older version.\n\nDespite this mismatch, both beta and non-beta users can coexist in the same instance, but what each user sees differs depending on the client version.\n\nNotably, avatar appearances seem unaffected and are consistent across both versions.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Open VRChat using the Open Beta version.\n\n2. Join the following world \"カフェ・オリビア\" (any instance type is fine):\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_00787c18-ae0b-416f-90b0-39ae297159e2",
